    LLM: 'Game: Wiezen. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Wiezen (Belgian Whist) is a Belgian 4-player trick-taking game with bidding and temporary alliances. 52-card deck, 13 each. Last card dealt = trump. Contracts: Troel (3 Aces, 4th Ace holder = partner), Solo (alone), Abondance (9+ alone), Misère (no tricks), Open Misère, Pico (exactly 1 trick), Solo Slim (all 13).',
    objective: 'Fulfill your contract by taking the agreed number of tricks (or losing every trick in Misère), alone or with a temporary partner, to score payment from opponents.',
    gameplay: 'Bidding: Troel (3 Aces), Vragen (propose partner), Solo (5+ alone), Abondance (9+ alone), Misère (no tricks/no trump), Open Misère (face-up), Pico (exactly 1), Solo Slim (all 13). Follow suit. Trump if possible.',
